    "solution": "1. Preparation • Perform Double Feed Detect Adj. (Printer Adjustment). (Refer to I. ADJUSTMENT/SETTING - SERVICE MODE - Machine Adjustment - Double Feed Detect Adj. (Printer Adjustment)) 2. Execute the IO Check (22-68) of the multi feed detection board/S (MFDBS) and the multi feed detection board/R (MFDBR) (PF 2nd tandem) 3. When the result of the IO Check in the step 2 is normal, the multi feed detection adjustment is not abnormal. Go on to the step 6 and later. 4. Check the connector connection between PFUDB and MFDBS, CN175 of PFUDB, CN210S of MFDBS, and the wiring. Then repair it when there is any abnormality. 5. Check the connector connection between PFUDB and MFDBR, CN176 of PFUDB, CN209S of MFDBR, and the wiring. Then repair it when there is any abnormality. 6. Replace MFDBS. 7. Replace MFDBR. 8. Replace PFUDB.",
