    "cause": "Rotation abnormality of the side shutter motor/1 is detected. Measures to take when alert occurs The main body and the option stop immediately. Estimated abnormal parts • PFU drive board (PFUDB) • Side shutter motor/1 (M44) • Shutter home sensor/Up2 (PS44) Correction Note ▪ The message \"Please call service\" is displayed on the panel. Solution 1. Execute the IO Check (20-20) of the side shutter motor/1 (Upper tray) (PF 2nd tandem). 2. When the result of the IO Check in the step 1 is normal, M44 is not abnormal. Go on to the step 3. 3. Check the status of the sensor (0 or 1) in the IO Check (21-56) of the shutter home sensor/Up2 (Upper tray) (PF 2nd tandem). 4. Execute the IO Check (20-20) of the side shutter motor/1 (Upper tray) (PF 2nd tandem) again. 5. Check the status of the sensor (0 or 1) in the IO Check (21-56) of the shutter home sensor/Up2 (Upper tray) (PF 2nd tandem). If the status of the sensor changes from the status when you checked in the step 3 (from 0 to 1, or from 1 to 0), PS44 is not abnormal. Go on to the step 7. 6. Check the connector connection of CN122 of PFUDB, CN507 of M44, CN505 of PS44, CN508 and CN500 of the relay connector, and the wiring. Then, repair it when there is any abnormality. 7. Replace PFUDB. 8. Replace M44. 9. Replace PS44. Faulty part isolation DIPSW Control during the detachment",
