    "class": "MB-511 (1st tandem/2nd tandem): Paper feed motor/BP rotation abnormality",
    "cause": "Rotation abnormality of the paper feed motor/BP is detected. Measures to take when alert occurs The main body and the option stop immediately. Estimated abnormal parts • PFU drive board (PFUDB) • DC power supply/3 (DCPS3) • Paper feed motor/BP (M50) • Interlock switch/1 (MS1) • Interlock switch/BP (MS10) Correction Note ▪ The message \"Please call service\" is displayed on the panel. Solution 1. Check that the MB-511 is connected. 2. Execute the IO Check (11-42) of the paper feed motor/BP (MB-511, 1st tandem) or the IO Check (20-42) of the paper feed motor/BP (MB-511, 2nd tandem). 3. When the result of the IO Check in the step 2 is normal, M50 is not abnormal. Go on to the step 4 and later. 4. Check the connector connection of CN182 of PFUDB, CN12 and CN13 of DCPS3, CN793 of M50, FT050 and FT051 of MS1, CN007 of the relay connector, CN239, CN787, CN788, CN807 and CN808, and the wiring. Then, repair it when there is any abnormality. 5. Replace PFUDB. 6. Replace DCPS3. 7. Replace M50. 8. Replace MS1. 9. Replace MS10. Faulty part isolation DIPSW Control during the detachment",
