    "cause": "On the initial adjustment of the developer height sensor/M (TCRS04), the average value of TCRS04 is the specified value or less. Measures to take when alert occurs The main body and the option stop immediately. Estimated abnormal parts • Developer height sensor/M (TCRS04) • Printer expansion board (EXNCB) Correction Note ▪ The message \"Please call service\" is displayed on the panel. Solution 1. Prior check • Check that the IU mount/M is installed properly. (Execute the IO Check (58-05) of the TCR set detection/M.) 2. Execute the IO Check (50-31) of the developer height sensor/M (TCRS04). 3. When the result of the IO Check in the step 2 is normal, TCRS04, EXNCB, and the wiring are not abnormal. Go on to step 5. For details of IO check results, refer to \"Table 1: Result check.\" K-528",
