    "solution": "1. Prior check • Close the process door properly. • Close the front door properly. (Check with the IO Check (25-20) of the front door sensor (PS001).) 2. Execute the IO Check (37-20). • When the result is [OK]: Go on to the step 3. • When the result is [Err1]: Replace IPB. • When the result is [Err2]: Go on to the step 4. 3. Check the connection condition between IPB and the writing unit. • Check the connector connection between IPB and LASDB/Y, CN1100 and CN1200 of IPB, CN200 (Relay connector), CN181 of LASDB/Y, and the wiring. Then, repair it when there is any abnormality. • Check the connector connection between IPB and LASDB/M, CN1500 and CN1501 of IPB, CN200M (Relay connector), CN181 of LASDB/M, and the wiring. Then, repair it when there is any abnormality. • Check the connector connection between IPB and LASDB/C, CN2100 and CN2200 of IPB, CN200C (Relay connector), CN181 of LASDB/C, and the wiring. Then, repair it when there is any abnormality. • Check the connector connection between IPB and LASDB/K, CN2400 and CN2401 of IPB, CN200K (Relay connector), CN181 of LASDB/K, and the wiring. Then, repair it when there is any abnormality. 4. Disconnect CN181 of LASDB/Y, CN181 of LASDB/M, CN181 of LASDB/C, CN181 of LASDB/K, CN200 (Relay connector), CN200M (Relay connector), CN200C (Relay connector), and CN200K (Relay connector). Then, execute the IO Check (37-21). • When the result is [OK]: Go on to the step 5. • When the result is [Err]: Replace IPB. 5. Connect only CN181 of LASDB/Y and CN200 (Relay connector). Then, execute the IO Check (37-24). • When the result is [OK]: Go on to the step 6. • When the result is [Err]: Replace the writing unit/Y. 6. Disconnect CN181 of LASDB/Y and CN200 (Relay connector), and then connect only CN181 of LASDB/C and CN200C (Relay connector). Then, execute the IO Check (37-24) again. • When the result is [OK]: Go on to the step 7. • When the result is [Err]: Replace the writing unit/C. 7. Connect CN181 of LASDB/Y, CN181 of LASDB/M, CN181 of LASDB/C, CN181 of LASDB/K, CN200 (Relay connector), CN200M (Relay connector), CN200C (Relay connector), and CN200K (Relay connector). Then, check CN1100, CN1200, CN1500, CN1501, CN2100, CN2200, CN2400 and CN2401 of IPB, and the wiring. Then repair it when there is any abnormality.",
