    "solution": "1. Prior check • Check that PFU, the main body, RU, and IQ-501 are installed properly. • Check the paper setting. • Check whether the scanner unit/1 and the scanner unit/2 is clean. • Check whether the high density paper is not used. • Check the connector and the wiring of VIF board (VIFB). • Check the wiring of the scanner unit/1 and the scanner unit/2. 2. Check the lightning of the exposure LED/1 (LED1) and the exposure LED/2 (LED2) during the initialization sequence after the machine is booted. 3. Check the connector connection between VIFB and IPB/U, CN501 and CN502 of VIFB, CN501 and CN502 of IPB/U, and the wiring. Then repair it when there is any abnormality. 4. Check the connector connection between IPB/U and the IQ relay board (PCB6), CN201 and CN202 of IPB/U, CN103 and CN104 of PCB6, and the wiring. Then repair it when there is any abnormality. 5. Replace the I/F cable/3 and the I/F cable/4. 6. Replace the I/F cable/B and I/F cable/C. 7. Replace μSDC. Note ▪ After you replace μSDC, reinstall the VI-514 firmware (ISW target: Q3). 8. Replace VICB and VIFB. 9. Replace IPB/U.",
